:: Mine Job Cleaning Intro
<<effects>>

The <<person>> shoves a bundle of rags into your hands. "Clean this place up," <<he>> says before quickly returning to <<his>> chair.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Cleaning
<<effects>>

You're in the guards' quarters. Guards sporadically enter and leave.
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	The guards openly stare at your <<lewdness>>.
<</if>>
<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<generate1>>
	You clutch your stomach and go to your knees. A <<person1>><<person>> notices you. <<He>> rushes to your side. You slip out of consciousness as <<he>> lifts you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Birth]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	You've pushed yourself too much.
	<br><br>

	<<passout>>
	<<link [[Everything fades to black...|Mine Job Cleaning Passout]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif Time.hour lte 5 or Time.hour gte 21>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning End]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Focus on cleaning (1:00)|Mine Job Cleaning Events]]>><<pass 1 hours>><<set $phase to 0>><<tiredness 5>><</link>><<ggtiredness>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Pretend to clean (1:00)|Mine Job Cleaning Events]]>><<pass 1 hours>><<set $phase to 1>><<stress 3>><</link>><<gstress>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Job Cleaning End
<<effects>><<generate1>>

A <<person1>><<person>> looks at <<his>> watch and walks up to you. "Day's over," <<he>> says. <<He>> grabs you and pulls you out of the cave and pushes you into a group of slaves.
<br><br>
You walk with them until you reach a metal gate leading to a small cave. The group filters through the gate, and when everyone is inside, the guard slams the gate shut.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Cleaning Events
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 0>>
	You focus on actually cleaning.
	<<if random(1,3) is 1>>
		<span class="green">You think you're getting better at this.<<housekeeping 2>><<ghousekeeping>></span>
	<</if>>
	<<print either(
		"You scrub off caked-on dust.",
		"You get a faceful of dust as you wipe off a shelf. It gets in your mouth and eyes, causing you to cough violently. <<pain 10>><<ggpain>> ",
		"You sweep up a broken bottle off the floor.",
		"You sop up a puddle on the floor.",
		"You clear trash off of one of the tables.",
		"You scrub boot prints off the floor."
	)>>
<<else>>
	You make it look like you're cleaning and try to keep out of sight of the guards. You hope the guards don't notice.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<cleareventpool>>

<<addinlineevent "dress_up">>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	You notice a guard staring at you from the corner of the room. You pay <<him>> no mind as you continue.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> quickly stands up and walks over to a bunk. <<He>> pulls a box out from under it. "Hey you, come here," <<he>> yells while pointing at you. You reluctantly walk towards <<him>> as <<he>> opens up the box. <span class="blue">You notice a black bottle tucked into a pile of clothing.</span>
