	<<link [[Pull away|Mine Job Cleaning Corner]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 1 15000>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "kiss">>
	<<generate1>>
	You notice a <<person1>><<person>> watching, <<his>> gaze focuses on your lips. You try to ignore <<him>> but <<he>> walks up to you and wraps <<his>> arm around your waist and tries to kiss you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Endure|Mine Job Cleaning Kiss]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><</link>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
