<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "beer">>
	<<generate1>><<generate2>>
	<<if $skulduggery gte 300>>
		You notice the guards starting to surround you and a <<person1>><<person>> about to grab you, <span class="green">but you're able to move out of the way in time.</span> The <<person>> collides with another guard.
		<br><br>
		"Looks like the <<bitch>> doesn't want <<pher>> medicine," a <<person2>><<person>> laughs. They don't try to grab you again and return to what they were doing.
	<<else>>
		You go about as normal when you get grabbed from behind by a <<person1>><<person>>, a <<person2>><<person>> walks up to you with a funnel and a bottle of beer.
		<br><br>
		"Open up. It's time for your medicine," <<he>> laughs. You feel hands force your mouth open as the <<person>> shoves the funnel into your mouth. You feel warm liquid pour down your throat, you manage to swallow it all. <<drunk 180>><<ggdrunk>>
		<br><br>
		The funnel is slowly removed from your throat, and the hands restraining your body retreat. You're left coughing on the ground as the guards return to what they were doing. <<pain 10>><<ggpain>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if !$mine.setup.map>>
	<<addinlineevent "map">>
		<<generate1>><<person1>>
		A <<person>> starts watching you from across the room. You ignore <<him>> and continue. As you avert your eyes away from <<him>>, you notice a small part of an old paper slipped behind a pin-up.
