		<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "nothing" 1.5>>
	You go on without interruption.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Cleaning]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "scream" 1.5>>
